		Paragraph: From `Heading 1` to `Heading 6`. A heading is not larger than a paragraph unless a rule says so: the look of each level comes from a `For element` rule in the `.styles.stxt` of this folder. A level cannot be skipped: a `Heading 3` comes after a `Heading 2`.
